#VRML_SIM R2025a utf8
# Wall-hugging lap with one foam block in the middle of each wall's lane (route_sim.py --layout lap).
# The arena is 1.4 m inside, centred on the world origin: arena_map.json (x, y) = world (x - 0.70, y - 0.70).
# Move a block by dragging it (keep it on the floor); the controller reads every Solid's outline at start.

